4	 * Server-side client for the FastAPI backend (backend/API.md). Only the adapter
5	 * handlers in src/backend use it; the browser keeps talking to /api.
6	 * Env: BACKEND_URL (default http://localhost:8000). Auth: X-User-Id (backend AUTH_MODE=dev).
